    "detailed_description": "Hellfight is a combat focused platformer that combine the experience of roguelike and soul-like mechanics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229450/extras/ddc76385a4ad0ffa97ac62620654fb12.poster.avif?t=1694048695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229450/extras/ddc76385a4ad0ffa97ac62620654fb12.webm?t=1694048695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229450/extras/ddc76385a4ad0ffa97ac62620654fb12.mp4?t=1694048695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Every enemy is uniquely designed, encourage different strategic approach and pacing. Each enemy with different combination offer a new level of challenge that will keep you on the edge of your seat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229450/extras/b562082073bb68617fd4615e61ebb46f.avif?t=1694048695\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229450/extras/fc72c03181bce97422f7db42df8271a1.avif?t=1694048695\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Supports mouse, keyboard and controller.</li></ul><br>Hellfight is in early development\u2014wishlist for updates on our progress.<br>You can expect this game to receive constant update even after release. Join the discord and tell me what do you think about the game!",
